@startuml SSD US 2.2.4 - Register Storage Area
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
  ActorBorderColor #000000
  ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
  ParticipantBorderColor #000000
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
  LifeLineBorderColor #000000
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
}

actor "Port Authority Officer" as Officer
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Officer
Officer -> System : 1: starts storage area registration
activate System
System  --> Officer : 1.1: request storage area data\n(identifier, type, location,\nmax capacity (TEU), current occupancy (TEU),\nserved docks)
deactivate System

Officer -> System : 2: provide requested data
activate System
System  --> Officer : 2.1: storage area created successfully

deactivate System
deactivate Officer

@enduml
